Third-party data

supabase/seed/10_provinces.sql, 20_districts.sql and 30_tambons.sql are derived from
"Thailand - Subnational Administrative Boundaries" (COD-AB), Royal Thai Survey Department,
published by OCHA on the Humanitarian Data Exchange (https://data.humdata.org/dataset/cod-ab-tha),
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution for Intergovernmental Organisations (CC BY-IGO 3.0).
Jaga simplified the geometry (tambons to about 10 m and 100 m, provinces to about 500 m) and
selected the provinces it covers. These are not official boundaries.
